                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d7f44877-1db4-389a-8966-be85c9fdeaee",
                        "entry_id": "db7ec724-ebec-3a36-b18f-9ceb361e70ba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "одноцветное контурное изображение чего-либо или кого-либо на фоне другого цвета, нарисованное или вырезанное"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ec6de1e-8145-3461-8434-f4f10f402e18",
                        "entry_id": "db7ec724-ebec-3a36-b18f-9ceb361e70ba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. смутные внешние очертания чего-либо или кого-либо, виднеющиеся в темноте, тумане"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bdb6099-ed6d-4fed-a259-6797b4d2bc8c",
                                "sense_id": "0ec6de1e-8145-3461-8434-f4f10f402e18",
                                "text": "«Кажется никого…»– подумал он, входя в беседку, и тут же увидел в углу человеческий силуэт."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "77d32df4-430e-3981-bc86-0991e15765c0",
                        "entry_id": "db7ec724-ebec-3a36-b18f-9ceb361e70ba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "линии, контур одежды"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4b4c070e-36ad-4b68-995a-1a4b8146da0a",
                        "source_entry_id": "db7ec724-ebec-3a36-b18f-9ceb361e70ba",
                        "target_lang_word": "silhouette",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silhouette",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "290398de-2432-3706-8394-d34c28dbf1ba",
                                        "entry_id": "ad0885a6-7288-3a06-a5ae-0d6799a59e8c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An illustrated outline filled in with a solid color(s), usually only black, and intended to represent the shape of an object without revealing any other visual details; a similar appearance produced when the object being viewed is situated in relative darkness with brighter lighting behind it; a profile portrait in black, such as a shadow appears to be."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58bbe4f1-ebc3-4f61-9585-6160eb779ac0",
                                                "sense_id": "290398de-2432-3706-8394-d34c28dbf1ba",
                                                "text": "I could see a silhouette of a figure looking out from the window, but I couldn't tell if it was a man or a woman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df7511bd-c5f2-445d-a04c-48f1c5bca38b",
                                                "sense_id": "290398de-2432-3706-8394-d34c28dbf1ba",
                                                "text": "At Stirling, we obtained a wonderful silhouette view of the Wallace Monument, and the dark line of the Ochil Hills, and the castle stood out clearly against the afterglow of the sunset."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "019ea62d-e0a8-318e-b5a8-8e67c7ee702e",
                                        "entry_id": "ad0885a6-7288-3a06-a5ae-0d6799a59e8c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The outline of a garment as it appears on the wearer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e0c6466-806e-4758-a4fd-2b1a3a29d2aa",
                                                "sense_id": "019ea62d-e0a8-318e-b5a8-8e67c7ee702e",
                                                "text": "A-line is a classic silhouette for dresses and skirts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "silhouette",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd4035cd-d584-36e7-bdfd-ddeba3970e7c",
                                        "entry_id": "5119945e-eba7-3f03-bf1d-6cbdb8adea2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To represent by a silhouette; to project upon a background, so as to be like a silhouette."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b4e049a-26ba-4805-af54-2eeea7936957",
                                                "sense_id": "dd4035cd-d584-36e7-bdfd-ddeba3970e7c",
                                                "text": "Scores of coconut-shell fires blazed with their characteristic glaring white flame, throwing grotesque shadows on the brown thatched huts, dancing fairylike shimmerings among the domes of coconut fronds, casting ghostly reaches of light through the adjacent graveyards, and silhouetting the forms of pareu-clad natives at work cleaning their fish or laying them on the live coals to broil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d7b3cd6-77f6-48da-a626-c45ddf0843de",
                                                "sense_id": "dd4035cd-d584-36e7-bdfd-ddeba3970e7c",
                                                "text": "Driving 2-6-2 locomotive No. 4771 Green Arrow, Blunt suddenly noticed that the tunnel mouth was silhouetted in a dazzling white glare and that incendiary bombs were showering down in their hundreds, he slammed on all his brakes and brought his train to a stop just inside the tunnel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "12b57265-913d-48c0-8b33-a998d4b1841a",
                        "source_entry_id": "db7ec724-ebec-3a36-b18f-9ceb361e70ba",
                        "target_lang_word": "sylwetka",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sylwetka",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e576de5-5cb6-3854-b028-7657e7bcdb1f",
                                        "entry_id": "da27d1dd-68ef-3fed-938d-dbafccc988be",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "kształt, zarys postaci lub rzeczy"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a02795d-826b-4835-9ecb-97660ad92910",
                                                "sense_id": "2e576de5-5cb6-3854-b028-7657e7bcdb1f",
                                                "text": "Na horyzoncie widać było sylwetkę statku."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f84dc57f-42ff-4df5-a4d0-ad01ac22ad75",
                                                "sense_id": "2e576de5-5cb6-3854-b028-7657e7bcdb1f",
                                                "text": "Ćwiczenia na wioślarzu pomagają zmniejszyć ilość tkanki tłuszczowej, wysmuklić sylwetkę, zwalczyć cellulit, a także pozytywnie wpływają na samopoczucie"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7d108b1d-d504-41d4-b1d4-0ceded564130",
                        "source_entry_id": "db7ec724-ebec-3a36-b18f-9ceb361e70ba",
                        "target_lang_word": "zarys",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zarys",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7950dc0c-3058-363a-bb83-e86ed8eb2d8c",
                                        "entry_id": "4624e17e-5b16-38d1-89b5-8ecf77183283",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ogólny kształt jakiegoś obiektu"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12a4dc9d-dd65-4441-97b0-7101d92b56bc",
                                                "sense_id": "7950dc0c-3058-363a-bb83-e86ed8eb2d8c",
                                                "text": "Cmentarz jakby się napełniał cieniami… tłumem widm… gąszczem mrocznych zarysów… gędźbą rozjęczonych a cichych głosów… […]"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85b22d3f-c7e7-38bb-a8dd-6e8b976b658f",
                                        "entry_id": "4624e17e-5b16-38d1-89b5-8ecf77183283",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "podstawy jakiegoś pomysłu lub zagadnienia"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fdd3e75-4086-4d61-9b6d-028454625828",
                                                "sense_id": "85b22d3f-c7e7-38bb-a8dd-6e8b976b658f",
                                                "text": "Ten krótki zarys przeszłości średniowiecznej Polski, będący częścią wspólnej historii Polski, Białorusi, Litwy i Ukrainy, obejmuje bardzo ważny okres — prawie połowę tysiącletniej historii, kiedy to położono solidne fundamenty polskiego społeczeństwa, państwa i kultury w ramach zachodnioeuropejskiej, chrześcijańskiej przestrzeni cywilizacyjnej."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee472289-6c3e-4dc8-8464-d571cce6289f",
                        "source_entry_id": "db7ec724-ebec-3a36-b18f-9ceb361e70ba",
                        "target_lang_word": "silhouette",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silhouette",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "290cbb7c-1308-3e21-9c52-f80f50f9e31c",
                                        "entry_id": "6ec05d1c-352c-3619-af9e-39c1b1450697",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sorte de dessin fait par un trait tracé autour de l’ombre du visage ou du corps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8caf9108-9563-45b2-94b6-96e643c22eef",
                                                "sense_id": "290cbb7c-1308-3e21-9c52-f80f50f9e31c",
                                                "text": "Dessiner à la silhouette."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02888125-70f5-37e7-b224-b5b8cd8cb7be",
                                        "entry_id": "6ec05d1c-352c-3619-af9e-39c1b1450697",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Apparence d’un corps, voire d’un objet, laissée par son contour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48fdd098-6898-4802-b9c2-a419d776a317",
                                                "sense_id": "02888125-70f5-37e7-b224-b5b8cd8cb7be",
                                                "text": "Rafaël […] suivit des yeux, aussi longtemps qu’il put la distinguer, la fatale silhouette qui se détachait en noir aux rayons de la lune…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "072d1db0-388b-4b55-ba73-7e963f9043d2",
                                                "sense_id": "02888125-70f5-37e7-b224-b5b8cd8cb7be",
                                                "text": "[…],: je fis environ cent mètres à plat ventre, […], pour arriver à une charrue dont la silhouette m’avait fait grand’peur."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e5d80c3-635e-4633-969f-a64d7e0965ce",
                                                "sense_id": "02888125-70f5-37e7-b224-b5b8cd8cb7be",
                                                "text": "Occupés à nos cuvettes et serviettes nous regardions vers Verdun, c’est-à-dire en arrière et à droite, où l’on voyait une silhouette de cathédrale ébréchée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c15e364-0028-46f6-aeeb-e2190a7f852e",
                                                "sense_id": "02888125-70f5-37e7-b224-b5b8cd8cb7be",
                                                "text": "J’aimais frôler au passage ces silhouettes, imperceptiblement trop rapides ou trop lentes, que le jour pour un moment mécanise et que la nuit avancée, comme une fin de course impitoyable, égrène au long des rues dans leur nudité tragique de grand fauve ou de bête boiteuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "562a6bb7-129f-415b-ad3a-ad776ed98a3e",
                                                "sense_id": "02888125-70f5-37e7-b224-b5b8cd8cb7be",
                                                "text": "La porte ouverte un moment laissa passer un rayon de lumière. J’entrevis sa silhouette : il était jeune, correctement habillé : […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2045bdf-a693-46d6-ab84-94bc7443ef55",
                                                "sense_id": "02888125-70f5-37e7-b224-b5b8cd8cb7be",
                                                "text": "Après un trajet de vingt minutes se dessina devant lui la silhouette de la petite ville de Saint-Laurent-Nouan, inhabituellement sombre en cette nuit, sans lumière aux fenêtres ni éclairage public."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "533dcd34-6b46-3477-8ea7-768f2f70cfb3",
                                        "entry_id": "6ec05d1c-352c-3619-af9e-39c1b1450697",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ligne qui dessine la forme du corps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "analogy"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01c48191-8961-4a42-b7d0-dd186627d5c2",
                                                "sense_id": "533dcd34-6b46-3477-8ea7-768f2f70cfb3",
                                                "text": "Les silhouettes des buissons frangeaient son chemin et il allait, tête levée, respirant large."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "923e1bcd-715e-40c9-9ce1-2efff1edfc4f",
                                                "sense_id": "533dcd34-6b46-3477-8ea7-768f2f70cfb3",
                                                "text": "Zara a copié des défilés, H&M et Uniqlo ont multiplié les collaborations, et les consommateurs découvert des vestiaires adaptables à toutes les silhouettes de mode et à bas prix."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbaea211-6806-4dae-a93a-f561d24e9a77",
                                                "sense_id": "533dcd34-6b46-3477-8ea7-768f2f70cfb3",
                                                "text": "Depuis plusieurs années, il s’était accoutumé à cette silhouette calme qui glissait sans bruit, autour de lui, à ce visage toujours paisible et souriant qui se penchait sur son fils."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23df3d63-580b-3c3c-bafa-454124feb2fb",
                                        "entry_id": "6ec05d1c-352c-3619-af9e-39c1b1450697",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Profil caractéristique d’une ville ou d’un paysage, tel qu’il se découpe sur le ciel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Urbanisme"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
